#: comic.cpp:337
msgid ""
"Maybe there is no Internet connection.\n"
"Maybe the comic plugin is broken.\n"
"Another reason might be that there is no comic for this day/number/string, "
"so choosing a different one might work."
msgstr ""
"Villicht steiht Dien Internetverbinnen nich.\n"
"Oder dat Comic-Moduul is schaadhaftig.\n"
"Oder för disse(n) Dag/Nummer/Tekenkeed gifft dat gor keen Comic, un en anner "
"löppt villicht."

